<p>All DQ Cakes share the same layer structure: soft serve base + hot fudge + crunchy center + whipped topping. The difference between cake options is the soft serve layer. Classic DQ Cakes use standard vanilla/chocolate soft serve. Blizzard Cakes use Blizzard-flavored soft serve with actual mix-in pieces distributed throughout. Find all DQ Cake prices on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>
